    {
      "text": "men cannot always judge righteous, D&C 10:37. the Spirit leads to judge righteously, D&C 11:12. Christ to judge all men according to works, D&C 19:3 (76:111; 137:9). world to be judged by witnesses, D&C 20:13. Twelve from Jerusalem to judge whole house of Israel, D&C 29:12. let God rule him who judges, D&C 58:20. let God judge between me and thee, D&C 64:11. the Lord made Church like unto judge to judge nations, D&C 64:37. inhabitants of Zion to judge all things pertaining to Zion, D&C 64:38. the Son preached gospel to those in prison, to be judged according to men in flesh, D&C 76:73 (88:99; 138:34; 1 Pet. 4:6). dead to be judged out of books, D&C 128:6–8 (Rev. 20:12).",
